Reload
- Opened /hackertube in the loopback dashboard.
- The address bar path became /hackertube with a profile query.
- Called location.reload().
- After reload the heading text was HackerTube.
- A nav link with href /hackertube had text HackerTube.
- Screenshot taken of that reloaded viewport.

Restart
- Stopped the dashboard process and started it again on the same loopback port.
- Opened /hackertube again.
- The heading text was HackerTube.
- Authenticated GET /api/plugins/hackertube/status returned 200.
- Body name was HackerTube, data_root ended in plugin-data/hackertube, model_key was absent.
- The profile home prefix is redacted. The session token is not recorded.
